[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_00_0010","text":"制作人，\n是出差吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_00_0020","text":"啊，我会带伴手礼回来的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_00_0030","text":"啊哈～\n要多买点回来哦～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_00_0040","text":"还会去泡温泉的吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_00_0004","text":"喂喂……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_00_0005","text":"不，\n哪有那种闲工夫……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_00_0006","text":"哈哈，\n我会好好享受的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_01_0010","text":"都说了不是去旅行啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_01_0020","text":"但是，又要玩又要吃，\n还要泡温泉的吧～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_02_0010","text":"……如果真有呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_02_0020","text":"……如果真有的话………………\n……………………那、那该怎么办呀……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_03_0010","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_06050000_03_0020","text":"……我会跟叶月小姐说一声的\n让她别给报销"}]
